            "review_text": "Femke\nLondon, United Kingdom21 contributions\n0\nGreat food, service poor\nNov 2018 • Couples\nThe food was great; very fresh and tasty. Yet we wouldn’t come back. The main waiter seemed outright disinterested. They brought out a dish we didn’t order and when we pointed this out they seemed rather annoyed. We went to pay with a 500,000 vnd note the person at the till groaned and rolled her eyes.\n\nMaybe it was a lack of English and we judged them unfairly, but a smile goes a long way.\nRead more\nWritten November 11, 2018",
